	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Binas a te accepi literas, optime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, cum semel ipse ad te scrips<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>erim, postquam a vobis discessi.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">In causa mei silentii non oblivio fuit, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>quomodo enim vestri oblivisci poteram, apud quos reliqui mei dimidium, imo me <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>totum renatum in <persName>Paulo Lismanino</persName>, non negligentia nec torpor.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Meministi enim, quanta cęleritate media hieme confecerim iter <placeName ref="l167">Gene<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>vense</placeName> te duobus annis tantum iunior, nec eremus mea, unde bis <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>it reditque <placeName ref="l260">Cracoviam</placeName> singulis diebus famulus, quum libet, penuria <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>tamen argumenti defuit homini minime poetico, imo vero <persName>Laconi</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Aliud erat garrire cum uxorcula, cum meo <persName ref="p8101">Lęlio</persName>, cum d. <persName>Guernero</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>de rebus domesticis, aliud vero ad te de religionis statu scribere, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>de quo nihil certi nec antea habebam, nec modo video, nisi quod dominus <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>miris modis suos tuetur et coercet impios.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">An non miracula <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>hęc tibi videntur, <persName ref="p20307">Aloysium Lippomanum</persName>, qui toto hoc biennio fere <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>veluti asinus leoninam indutus territavit <placeName ref="l2472">Polonos</placeName>, confusum adventu <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>d. <persName ref="p8041">Ioannis a Lasco</persName> et strenuitate d. <persName ref="p3375">Vergerii</persName> ex hoc reno, si non clan<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>cu<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>lum, per aliam viam tamen, quam prae se ferebat palam, discessisse, <persName>Lismaninum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>vero eius opera proscriptum in hypocausto ligneo cum clarissimis <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>viris d. <persName ref="p8041">Ioanne a Lasco</persName> et d. <persName ref="p3375">Vergerio</persName> cenitare de admirandisque <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>huiusmodi dei operibus colloqui?</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Reliqua et minutissima <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>quęque ex d. <persName ref="p3375">Vergerio</persName> disces, qui versatus est in luce hominum me <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>interea in eremo latitante.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Cum rev. d. <persName ref="p8041">Ioannes a Lasco</persName> redierit <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>a rege, quod ante pascha futurum speramus, vel hinc vel, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>quod citius credo, ex <placeName ref="l268">Regiomonte</placeName> scribam, ubi liber a proscriptione <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>usque ad futura comitia fruar consuetudine ill. mi ducis <placeName ref="l2562">Prussię</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Sic visum est ecclesię, cui ut paream, et deus et vocatio mea <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>me cogunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, clarissime vir et mihi modis omnibus colende, et ecclesiar<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>um <placeName ref="l2472">polonicarum</placeName> ac tui <persName ref="p1936">Lismanini</persName> in tuis ad deum praecationibus <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>esto memor.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Tuam domesticam ecclesiam, eruditos et pios tuos generos d. <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p7228">Zwinglium</persName>, <persName ref="p1884">Lavaterum</persName> et <persName ref="p8442">Simlerum</persName> pariter et illorum coniuges honestissimas <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>foeminas, tuas charissimas filias, reverenter et amanter saluto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Si qua in re uxor mea tua opera opus habuerit in hac sua profectione, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ne illi desis cert us me vel per mercatores.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l473">Sti. Galli</placeName> vel per meum <persName>Stan<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>islaum</persName> te indemnem facturum.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Ex eremo <placeName ref="l2472">sarmatica</placeName> 6. martii 1557.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Nedum rev. <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>d. <persName ref="p8318">Foelix Cruciger</persName> superintendens et d. <persName ref="p8513">Alexander Vitrellinus</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z9"/><placeName ref="l957">Pinczowiensis</placeName> pastor tibi maximas agunt gratias, quod tanti illos facias, verum <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>omnes eorum sym(m)istę, quorum nomina hic tibi descripta mitto, te reverenter sa<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>lutant sum(m)opereque precantur, ut tuis et eruditis et piis literis eos et excites <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>et soleris, apud dominum vero tuis precibus semper iuves.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z13"/><persName ref="p8493">Gregorius Paulus</persName>, artium liberalium magister, vir eruditus et cum <placeName ref="l587">Tigurina</placeName> ac <lb xml:id="p2z14"/><placeName ref="l167">Genevensi</placeName> ecclesiis per omnia consentiens, ecclesię Christi in <placeName>Pelsnice</placeName> minister.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z15"/><persName ref="p7961">Iacobus Sylvius</persName> ecclesię Christi in <placeName ref="l2607">Kreziczyeze</placeName> minister.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z16"/><persName ref="p7925">Stanislaus Liuthomirski</persName> equestris ordinis indefessus Christi miles, <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>ecclesię in parva <placeName>Casmiria</placeName> minister doctus et facundus.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z18"/><persName ref="p2876">Stanislaus Sarniczki</persName> equestris ordinis ecclesię Christi in <placeName ref="l2608">Niedzwiecz</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>minister eruditus.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z20"/><persName ref="p8480">Martinus Croviezki</persName> equestris ordinis doctus, pius et facundus ecclesię <lb xml:id="p2z21"/><placeName ref="l560">Wlodislaviensis</placeName> minister.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z22"/><persName>Martinus Taurinus</persName> zelo et strenuitate pręstans ecclesię <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>apud magnum d. <persName ref="p20309">Martinum Sborovski</persName> palatinum <placeName ref="l2049">Kalisiensem</placeName> minister.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z24"/><persName>Ioannes Siekirenczki</persName> equestris ordinis pietate insignis ecclesię <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>in <placeName>Iwanowicze</placeName> apud magnam d. <persName ref="p824">Agnetem Dluskam</persName>, matrem nobilem <lb xml:id="p2z26"/><persName>Nicolai</persName> et <persName>Alberti Dlusiorum</persName>, qui sunt vestri hospites, minister<pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z2"/><persName>Melchior Philipenski</persName> equestris ordinis ecclesię in <placeName>Cossow</placeName> minister.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z3"/>Hos et quod sępius me in <persName>Eremo</persName> latitantem inviserint et quod <lb xml:id="p3z4"/>tuis scriptis pręsertim decadibus et compendio ac expositione <lb xml:id="p3z5"/>apologetica delectentur, notos de nomine tibi esse volui.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Sunt plures <lb xml:id="p3z6"/>in <placeName ref="l2606">Polonia maiore</placeName>, in <placeName ref="l859">Russia</placeName>, in <placeName ref="l700">Masovia</placeName> et in magno ducatu <lb xml:id="p3z7"/><placeName ref="l841">Lithuanie</placeName>, quorum aliquos et de facie et de nomine novi, sed de <lb xml:id="p3z8"/>te cum illis nihil contuli propter maximam distantiam locorum.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Rursum vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z9"/>Ut possis polonica nomina exprimere preter <placeName ref="l2472">Polonos</placeName> studiosos consule <lb xml:id="p3z10"/>d. <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName>, quem ego audiveram contendentem cum <persName>Stanislao</persName> <lb xml:id="p3z11"/>meo famulo super vocabulo <placeName ref="l2607">Krezieczycze</placeName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><placeName ref="l2607">Krzcięcice</placeName>, vgl. Akta synodów, Register.</note> etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Rogo, ut a me <lb xml:id="p3z12"/>per te reverenter salutetur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[<persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Hand hat auf dem Briefe vermerkt:]</note>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z13"/>Has literas accepi demum <lb xml:id="p3z14"/>sub finem anni 1557 a festo <lb xml:id="p3z15"/>natali per <persName ref="p8101">Laelium</persName> a <lb xml:id="p3z16"/><persName ref="p3375">Vergerio</persName>, a quo ille <lb xml:id="p3z17"/>veniebat, accepi resignatas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Die Adresse von anderer Hand geschrieben:]</note>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Doctissimo et pietate praestantissimo <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, eccle(siae <lb xml:id="p4z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tig)urinae</placeName> pastori fidelissimo et.<lb xml:id="p4z4"/>.. mo, d. et patri colendissimo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p4z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
